          "title": "You'll want to know: богатый",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "богатый (bogátyy) — \"rich\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "богатый (bogátyy) comes from Proto-Slavic bogŭ: Vasmer gives both readings, \"god\", so \"favoured by the gods\" like Latin fortūnātus, and \"a share, wealth\", as in убогий, \"poor\", \"without a share\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
